References
========================================================================

   1. Small Bodies Node PDS dataset nh-a-lorri_mvic-5-geophys-v1.0
      contains the "(486958) Arrokoth Coordinate System Document"
      document, by Ross Beyer and Simon Porter. This document,
      named "document/arrokoth_csd.pdf", contains an overview of the
      Arrokoth coordinate system. Note, however, that several values
      in this document are less precise than the ones in this kernel.


P_constants (PcK) SPICE kernel file for Arrokoth (aka 2014 MU69)
===========================================================================

       By: Hal Weaver (JHU-APL)    2021 April 12 (revised version).
       Added frames definitions; original file did not have these.
       Changed filename; original name was "pck_mu69.tpc". 

       By: Hal Weaver (JHU-APL)    2019 May 19 (revised version; 
       radii are for larger lobe from Stern et al., Science, v364, 2019).
       Original filename was "pck_mu69.tpc".
              
       By: Hal Weaver (JHU-APL)    2019 February 26 (original version)
       Original filename was "pck_mu69.tpc".

Based on data from Simon Porter (SwRI), as received from Ross Beyer (NASA-ARC).

